---
// Hero.astro - Seção principal SaaSCore Sistemas | SGEMH
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-28 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-36">
  <!-- Efeitos de iluminação de fundo (Glows sutis cyan & blue) -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 left-1/2 -z-10 h-[500px] w-[700px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/15 blur-[120px]"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-40 right-10 -z-10 h-[400px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 blur-[130px]"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <!-- Badges de Empresa & Conformidade -->
      <div class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-md">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          SaaSCore Sistemas
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300 backdrop-blur-md">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500"></span>
          </span>
          Rastreabilidade RBC / Inmetro
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-300 backdrop-blur-md">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
          </span>
          ANVISA RDC 665 & RDC 509
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Headline B2B de Alto Impacto -->
      <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
        <span class="text-white">SGEMH:</span> Sistema de <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-cyan-200 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Gerenciamento Eletrônico de Engenharia Clínica
        </span>
        <br />
        e Gestão de Ativos em Saúde
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtítulo Explicativo -->
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-300 sm:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Desenvolvido pela <strong>SaaSCore Sistemas</strong> para hospitais, clínicas e redes de saúde. 
        Controle integral de inventário técnico, ordens de serviço (OS), calibrações com rastreabilidade RBC e conformidade regulatória contínua.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs Primário e Secundário -->
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <a
          href="#contato"
          class="group inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/25 transition-all hover:bg-cyan-400 hover:shadow-cyan-500/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-400"
        >
          <span>Agendar Demonstração do SGEMH</span>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#recursos"
          class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-200 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500"
        >
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Conhecer Módulos do Sistema</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Métricas / Indicadores Rápidos -->
      <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-y border-slate-800/80 py-8 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400 sm:text-4xl">99.8%</span>
          <span class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">Disponibilidade Operacional</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl font-black text-white sm:text-4xl">100%</span>
          <span class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">Conformidade Normativa</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400 sm:text-4xl">+50k</span>
          <span class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">Ativos Hospitalares Geridos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl font-black text-white sm:text-4xl">&lt; 2h</span>
          <span class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">Tempo Médio de Atendimento</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
